    "identifier": "keton-plasma-release-plasma-beam",
    "description": "<p>You create and shoot out a beam of plasma, piercing and cauterizing whatever it strikes. Make a ranged ninjutsu attack against a creature you can see in range, dealing 3d8 fire damage on a hit and forcing the affected creature to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, the affected creature is marked with Convergence, until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the number of attacks you can make with this jutsu by +1.</p>",
